#: ../../tools/orthodb_tools.rst:36 35eca94bd9fa478ebce56e5b4784635e
msgid ""
"``group_id`` (string) (required) OrthoDB group ID. Format: "
"'numberATtaxid'. Examples: '727649at7742' (Vertebrata level), "
"'59506at9443' (Primates level). Get IDs from OrthoDB\\_search\\_groups."
msgstr ""

