#: ../../tools/orthodb_tools.rst:63 f42251f05c0940ccbd97b4e1fe17ddcf
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get orthologous genes from an OrthoDB group, optionally "
"filtered by species. Returns gene IDs, organism names, and descriptions "
"for all members of an orthologous group. Useful for finding orthologs "
"across species, evolutionary conservation analysis, and functional "
"annotation transfer. Example: group '727649at7742' with species=9606 "
"returns human genes in that orthologous group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/orthodb_tools.rst:67 09f6e858c4414219800a361ba30f761f
msgid ""
"``group_id`` (string) (required) OrthoDB group ID. Format: "
"'numberATtaxid'. Get IDs from OrthoDB\\_search\\_groups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/orthodb_tools.rst:70 44f3e241808f4f209a739bbfa815f83c
msgid ""
"``species`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated NCBI taxonomy IDs "
"to filter. Examples: '9606' (human only), '9606,10090' (human+mouse). "
"Null for all species."
msgstr ""

